# Build first: cargo build --example mouse
Output docs/public/recordings/mouse.gif
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set FontSize 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 20ms
Env TERM "xterm-256color"
Env COLORTERM "truecolor"
Env NO_COLOR ""
Hide
Type "python3 docs/scripts/mouse-demo.py"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Show
Sleep 10s
Hide
Sleep 4s
